WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.235 --> 00:00:00.885
- Get it out.

00:00:00.885 --> 00:00:01.768
Do you see it?

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.695
If I go like this, if I go like this.

00:00:03.695 --> 00:00:04.107
- Maybe look the other way.

00:00:04.107 --> 00:00:04.966
- If I go like this.

00:00:04.966 --> 00:00:07.648
(rhythmic music)

00:00:08.652 --> 00:00:10.254
It's like...

00:00:10.254 --> 00:00:12.204
it's literally stuck behind my eyeball.

00:00:12.204 --> 00:00:13.609
It's in my brain.

00:00:31.185 --> 00:00:32.736
(loud groaning)

00:00:36.317 --> 00:00:39.405
Ow! Ow!

00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:40.659
Amy!

00:00:40.659 --> 00:00:41.518
Ow!

00:00:41.518 --> 00:00:42.890
Whose is that?

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:44.130
- It's Mike's, I'm so sorry.

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:45.472
- Oh my god.

00:00:53.255 --> 00:00:54.178
(sighing)

00:00:54.178 --> 00:00:55.102
Shit.

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:56.790
(groaning)

00:01:04.115 --> 00:01:04.987
Morning.

00:01:08.266 --> 00:01:09.741
Ow!

00:01:11.201 --> 00:01:12.538
- You brush your teeth first, huh?

00:01:13.449 --> 00:01:14.396
- Shit!

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:16.549
(loud groaning)

00:01:16.549 --> 00:01:18.104
- How do you get it lost in there?

00:01:18.104 --> 00:01:20.635
- I don't know, but
it's like behind my eye.

00:01:20.635 --> 00:01:23.027
What if you like pull my eyelid?

00:01:23.027 --> 00:01:24.165
Don't curl it, don't touch it.

00:01:24.165 --> 00:01:24.838
- Ew!

00:01:24.838 --> 00:01:25.535
- Do you see it?

00:01:25.535 --> 00:01:26.603
- Becky!

00:01:26.603 --> 00:01:28.019
Becky, don't touch your eye!

00:01:28.019 --> 00:01:28.840
- Sarah!

